13,0,0\" id=\"p-rc_65e0328ceba11157-152\" style=\"\"><strong><span class=\"citation-494 citation-end-494\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\">Cách dùng:<source-footnote _nghost-ng-c1970046839=\"\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c1970046839=\"\" class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"28\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><!----></sup></source-footnote></span></strong> <span class=\"citation-493 citation-end-493\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\">Uống trực tiếp từ lon hoặc rót ra ly.<source-footnote _nghost-ng-c1970046839=\"\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c1970046839=\"\" class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"29\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><!----></sup></source-footnote></span> <span class=\"citation-492 citation-end-492\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\">Ngon hơn khi uống lạnh sâu (nhiệt độ từ 4°C - 8°C), không nên uống kèm quá nhiều đá để giữ trọn vẹn vị êm mượt.<source-footnote _nghost-ng-c1970046839=\"\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c1970046839=\"\" class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"30\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><!----></sup></source-footnote></span><sources-carousel-inline _nghost-ng-c3257456824=\"\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><source-inline-chip _ngcontent-ng-c3257456824=\"\" _nghost-ng-c1360384063=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></source-inline-chip><!----><!----><!----></sources-carousel-inline></p></li><li style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><p data-path-to-node=\"13,1,0\" id=\"p-rc_65e0328ceba11157-153\" style=\"\"><strong><span class=\"citation-491 citation-end-491\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\">Bảo quản:<source-footnote _nghost-ng-c1970046839=\"\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin